{"loginSessionId":"","success":true,"errMsg":"","errCode":"0","content":{"problemId":"164448897","userProblemId":"22","question":"<p>1.</p> \n<p>求<span contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"CgTex\" style=\"width:40px;height:34px;\">$∁_{\\mathbf{R}}B$</span>：<br><span contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"CgTex\" style=\"width:150px;height:26px;\">$B=\\left\\{x\\mid1&lt;x&lt;2\\right\\}$</span>，补集是“不属于<span contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"CgTex\" style=\"width:19px;height:26px;\">$B$</span>的所有实数”，即<img src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;height:auto;\">。</p> \n<p></p> \n<p>2.</p> \n<p>分析<span contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"CgTex\" style=\"width:119px;height:36px;\">$A\\cup(∁_{\\mathbf{R}}B)=\\mathbf{R}$</span>的条件：<br><img src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251021000922672_31875_vttPEWpy.png\">，要让<span contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"CgTex\" style=\"width:19px;height:26px;\">$A$</span>和补集的并集是全体实数，<span contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"CgTex\" style=\"width:19px;height:26px;\">$A$</span>必须覆盖补集没包含的区间——<span contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"CgTex\" style=\"width:78px;height:26px;\">$1&lt;x&lt;2$</span>。</p> \n<p></p> \n<p>3.</p> \n<p>定<span contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"CgTex\" style=\"width:17px;height:26px;\">$a$</span>的范围：<br>只有<span contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"CgTex\" style=\"width:48px;height:26px;\">$a\\ge2$</span>时，<img src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;height:auto;\">才能完全包含<span contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"CgTex\" style=\"width:78px;height:26px;\">$1&lt;x&lt;2$</span>（若<span contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"CgTex\" style=\"width:48px;height:26px;\">$a&lt;2$</span>，会漏<span contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"CgTex\" style=\"width:78px;height:26px;\">$a\\le x&lt;2$</span>这部分，无法并成<span contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"CgTex\" style=\"width:21px;height:29px;\">$\\mathbf{R}$</span>）。</p> \n<p></p> \n<p>1</p>","imgUrl":"https://photo.91chengguo.com/image/user/3157288/20250925095242_368/af8675a54cf04a0086ec8e3eb742b746_1606x1187.jpg","courseType":"chemistry","master_271":"不懂","tagList":[{"tagId":2,"paramName":"masteryLevel","name":"不懂","color":"9B9B9B","tagValue":null,"system":null},{"tagId":-2,"paramName":"wrongTimes","name":"错0 对0","color":"9B9B9B","tagValue":null,"system":null},{"tagId":7623644,"paramName":"problemSource","name":"53高考3年模拟","color":"9B9B9B","tagValue":null,"system":null},{"tagId":-3,"paramName":"paperTimes","name":"组卷13","color":"9B9B9B","tagValue":null,"system":null}],"problem_type":"photo","originType":null,"useQuestionRepo":true,"matchQuestionRepo":true,"hasSimilar":true,"answer":"<p><img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103918623_388_NuFQBjaG.png\" style=\"width: 22px; height: auto;\"></p>\n<p>判断离子方程式是否正确，需遵循<strong>客观反应事实</strong>、<strong>拆写规则</strong>（易溶且易电离的物质拆为离子，沉淀/气体/弱电解质/氧化物不拆）、<strong>守恒（电荷/原子）</strong> 三大原则。</p>\n<p>反应事实：铜（Cu）在金属活动性顺序中位于氢（H）之后，<strong>不能与稀硫酸反应生成氢气</strong>，该反应本身不发生。</p>\n<p>结论：错误。</p>\n<p>1.反应本质：石灰石主要成分<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103919116_388_fZVgDes6.png\" style=\"width: 49px; height: auto;\">（沉淀，不拆）与盐酸（<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103919562_388_8bpnZvRj.png\" style=\"width: 28px; height: auto;\">，强电解质，拆为<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103920022_388_CIIGiev9.png\" style=\"width: 22px; height: auto;\">和<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103920487_388_nfJ2b32a.png\" style=\"width: 26px; height: auto;\">）反应，生成的<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103920923_388_Gn8Tvg20.png\" style=\"width: 48px; height: auto;\">（弱电解质，不稳定）会立即分解为<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103921371_388_rf13Akc5.png\" style=\"width: 31px; height: auto;\">（气体）和<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103921796_388_HxqVqF2f.png\" style=\"width: 31px; height: auto;\">（弱电解质），正确反应方程式为：<br><img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103922250_388_EA1zsXPa.png\" style=\"width: 279px; height: auto;\"> &nbsp;</p>\n<p>2.离子方程式错误点：</p>\n<p>未拆写<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103922690_388_a7jgkoL0.png\" style=\"width: 28px; height: auto;\">（应拆为<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103923142_388_IoW1okvY.png\" style=\"width: 22px; height: auto;\">和<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103923553_388_7KxreHNa.png\" style=\"width: 26px; height: auto;\">）；</p>\n<p>错误保留<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103923977_388_KBwirNSS.png\" style=\"width: 48px; height: auto;\">，且标注“<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103924412_388_vR6k1wno.png\" style=\"width: 10px; height: auto;\">”（<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103924845_388_8PAIB2uk.png\" style=\"width: 48px; height: auto;\">是溶液中的弱电解质，无沉淀符号）。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>结论：错误。</p>\n<p>1.反应本质：<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103925295_388_buUc0A7M.png\" style=\"width: 47px; height: auto;\">（拆为<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103925722_388_7jfiWAbm.png\" style=\"width: 35px; height: auto;\">、<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103926156_388_1thHAHLD.png\" style=\"width: 36px; height: auto;\">）与<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103926607_388_7BNHQP9w.png\" style=\"width: 61px; height: auto;\">（拆为<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103927077_388_FBAsCLZi.png\" style=\"width: 34px; height: auto;\">、<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103927524_388_7OYCaJqW.png\" style=\"width: 34px; height: auto;\">）反应，除了<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103927967_388_0JXNrTdz.png\" style=\"width: 36px; height: auto;\">与<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103928405_388_WnLaY5JV.png\" style=\"width: 34px; height: auto;\">生成<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103928817_388_mlSATSlT.png\" style=\"width: 46px; height: auto;\">沉淀，<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103929263_388_Tyy7gxfG.png\" style=\"width: 35px; height: auto;\">与<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103929708_388_3obFRjlt.png\" style=\"width: 34px; height: auto;\">还会生成<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103930137_388_EswIXWjC.png\" style=\"width: 62px; height: auto;\">沉淀（易遗漏）。</p>\n<p>2.正确离子方程式：<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103930568_388_GFyvCXi2.png\" style=\"width: 375px; height: auto;\">。</p>\n<p>3.错误点：遗漏<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103930997_388_SAAnXODy.png\" style=\"width: 35px; height: auto;\">与<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103931428_388_8iEV5mje.png\" style=\"width: 34px; height: auto;\">的反应，离子方程式不完整。</p>\n<p>结论：错误。</p>\n<p>1.反应本质：<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103931869_388_UK8WKKlA.png\" style=\"width: 35px; height: auto;\">（金属氧化物，不拆）与盐酸（拆为<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103932302_388_NmgajIC6.png\" style=\"width: 22px; height: auto;\">、<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103932733_388_9ot5aJv3.png\" style=\"width: 26px; height: auto;\">）反应，生成<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103933153_388_fchpqzPX.png\" style=\"width: 44px; height: auto;\">（易溶，拆为<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103933600_388_IbSzvH5k.png\" style=\"width: 38px; height: auto;\">、<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103934047_388_qCb60uOX.png\" style=\"width: 26px; height: auto;\">）和<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103934451_388_u0Y4rdHy.png\" style=\"width: 31px; height: auto;\">（弱电解质，不拆）。</p>\n<p>2.离子方程式推导：<br>化学方程式：<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103934890_388_Y5PPLsgq.png\" style=\"width: 206px; height: auto;\"><br>拆写后：<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103935325_388_DQAWSylu.png\" style=\"width: 298px; height: auto;\"><br>删去两边相同的<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103935781_388_Pm3HHBq0.png\" style=\"width: 26px; height: auto;\">：<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103936194_388_Jey6Yj7O.png\" style=\"width: 193px; height: auto;\"> &nbsp;</p>\n<p>3.验证：符合反应事实，拆写正确，电荷守恒（左边<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103936639_388_NCvnjy4Q.png\" style=\"width: 98px; height: auto;\">，右边<img class=\"formula-inline\" alt=\"橙果错题本\" src=\"https://question.91chengguo.com/chengguo/164448897/20251010103937081_388_T3NJ2n1Z.png\" style=\"width: 21px; height: auto;\">）、原子守恒。</p>\n<p>结论：正确。</p>","analyze":null,"countTime":null,"createDate":"2025.09.25","createTime":"2025-09-25 09:52:42","examKnowledge":null,"knowledgePoint":null,"imgWidth":1606,"imgHight":1187,"originalUrl":"https://photo.91chengguo.com/image/user/3157288/20250925103801_465/a13e16e2c4db4700946db9ddfc91a09f_810x599.jpg","originalUrlSize":{"width":810,"height":599},"rightUrl":null,"rightUrlSize":null,"imgUrlList":["https://photo.91chengguo.com/image/user/3157288/20250925095242_368/af8675a54cf04a0086ec8e3eb742b746_1606x1187.jpg"],"imgUrlListSize":[{"width":1606,"height":1187}],"originalUrlList":["https://photo.91chengguo.com/image/user/3157288/20250925103801_465/a13e16e2c4db4700946db9ddfc91a09f_810x599.jpg"],"originalUrlListSize":[{"width":810,"height":599}],"rightUrlList":[],"rightUrlListSize":[],"remark":"","remarkUrl":null,"remarkUrlSize":null,"remarkUrlList":[],"remarkUrlListSize":[],"answerText":"","knowledgePointTags":[],"questionTypeTags":[],"moreTagList":[{"tagId":7623643,"paramName":"customerTagIds",